WEBVTT

01:36.410 --> 01:41.020
[The Journey of Legend]

01:41.420 --> 01:43.930
[Episode 8]

01:44.610 --> 01:46.490
[Qunfang House]

01:47.509 --> 01:48.350
Miss Hongxiu.

01:49.509 --> 01:51.240
Someone is causing us trouble.

01:51.310 --> 01:52.370
I wonder if we could

01:53.509 --> 01:54.710
hide here for a while.

01:55.640 --> 01:57.509
Third Young Master, what are you saying?

01:57.509 --> 01:58.840
Everyone knows that the Xiao Residence

01:58.840 --> 01:59.700
is under siege.

02:00.480 --> 02:01.410
I heard your family

02:01.410 --> 02:03.560
is doing something important
for the country and its people.

02:03.560 --> 02:04.950
As a mere courtesan,

02:04.950 --> 02:07.210
I'm happy to offer what little help I can.

02:11.530 --> 02:12.210
Thank you.

02:13.190 --> 02:14.240
No need to thank me.

02:14.240 --> 02:15.240
Besides,

02:15.460 --> 02:16.920
aren't you a regular here?

02:17.190 --> 02:18.920
It's only right that I help you.

02:20.630 --> 02:22.430
I'm... not.

02:26.840 --> 02:28.400
Mister, please don't misunderstand.

02:28.400 --> 02:29.760
Third Young Master used to come here

02:29.760 --> 02:30.990
to help these girls.

02:31.400 --> 02:32.680
When thugs bullied them,

02:32.680 --> 02:34.680
only he treated us like human beings

02:34.710 --> 02:35.770
and stood up for us.

02:36.840 --> 02:38.900
We're all grateful for his kindness.

02:40.750 --> 02:42.280
It was the right thing to do.

02:43.750 --> 02:44.350
By the way,

02:44.630 --> 02:45.710
this place is too conspicuous

02:45.710 --> 02:46.680
and not very safe.

02:46.680 --> 02:48.740
I'll take you to another place later.

02:50.079 --> 02:52.590
How can we leave town now?

02:53.360 --> 02:54.280
Leave town?

02:55.230 --> 02:57.760
All roads out of town
are blocked by those men.

02:58.320 --> 03:00.830
We need to find a way out.

03:02.420 --> 03:04.910
Oh right, there's a party
outside out of town today.

03:04.910 --> 03:07.070
They requested some girls
for entertainment.

03:07.070 --> 03:07.950
Unless...

03:09.310 --> 03:10.040
Unless what?

03:10.870 --> 03:13.730
Unless you disguise yourselves
as girls from here.

03:17.510 --> 03:18.070
No way.

03:18.750 --> 03:19.680
Absolutely not.

03:19.910 --> 03:21.280
That makes things difficult.

03:21.280 --> 03:23.010
What about the night soil cart?

03:23.079 --> 03:24.910
The night soil cart smells terrible.

03:24.910 --> 03:26.680
They probably won't check it carefully.

03:26.680 --> 03:27.560
If you go with the cart,

03:27.560 --> 03:29.020
you might slip out of town.

03:29.750 --> 03:31.079
I'll go look into it now.

03:31.520 --> 03:32.120
What if...

03:33.430 --> 03:35.760
Don't you usually have many clever ideas?

03:35.790 --> 03:38.520
Are we really going to
hide in that stinking cart?

03:41.560 --> 03:42.490
There's no time.

03:42.870 --> 03:44.600
The meeting point has changed.

03:45.000 --> 03:47.329
Old Madam Wu and the others
don't know yet.

03:47.590 --> 03:49.190
I must leave town quickly

03:49.910 --> 03:51.430
and find Old Madam Wu.

03:56.800 --> 03:57.430
Master.

03:58.820 --> 04:00.800
I've searched all the main roads
from the Xiao Residence,

04:00.800 --> 04:02.730
but there's no sign of Old Madam Wu.

04:03.190 --> 04:04.870
I don't know where she is now.

04:06.030 --> 04:07.490
No need to search anymore.

04:08.680 --> 04:11.140
This Xiao Qiushui
always has unusual ideas.

04:12.080 --> 04:15.040
Even I was deceived about
Old Madam Wu's whereabouts.

04:15.040 --> 04:16.500
You won't find her either.

04:16.630 --> 04:18.829
It's my fault for being so slow-witted.

04:19.000 --> 04:20.390
What should we do next?

04:21.310 --> 04:23.310
The Sword King's men
are all over the streets.

04:23.310 --> 04:24.310
I wondered why he

04:24.520 --> 04:26.520
didn't confront me at Huanhua Sect.

04:27.450 --> 04:29.470
Turns out he was
setting an ambush out here.

04:29.470 --> 04:31.670
He wants to reap the benefits in the end.

04:32.680 --> 04:35.409
But Xiao Qiushui
hasn't met with Old Madam Wu yet.

04:35.750 --> 04:37.680
Why is the Sword King so confident?

04:38.070 --> 04:39.510
He's able to hold back his forces

04:39.510 --> 04:41.310
yet specifically set up checkpoints here.

04:41.310 --> 04:43.770
This proves Xiao Qiushui's guess
was right.

04:43.980 --> 04:46.580
There must be another spy
close to Old Madam Wu.

04:47.010 --> 04:49.370
All our spies have taken Misery Pills

04:49.400 --> 04:51.330
and are registered in our records.

04:51.720 --> 04:54.180
Mr. Qiu is our only spy
in the Xiao Residence.

04:55.430 --> 04:56.690
That nameless person?

04:58.870 --> 05:00.070
The Nameless Demon?

05:00.430 --> 05:01.360
All these years,

05:01.870 --> 05:03.800
among all the Sword King's people,

05:04.040 --> 05:05.000
only this Nameless Demon

05:05.000 --> 05:06.330
remains unidentified.

05:07.630 --> 05:08.960
You follow me in secret.

05:09.900 --> 05:10.850
Xiao Qiushui

05:11.560 --> 05:13.560
will lead us to Old Madam Wu himself.

05:14.310 --> 05:15.160
By then,

05:15.880 --> 05:18.080
the Nameless Demon will surely appear.

05:18.390 --> 05:22.000
I want to see who this person really is.

06:19.070 --> 06:20.000
What's going on?

06:20.160 --> 06:22.220
You took so long just to get some food.

06:24.070 --> 06:26.200
People are searching everywhere outside.

06:26.200 --> 06:27.760
I had to be extra cautious.

06:39.920 --> 06:42.450
What's the point of writing down
these sects?

06:44.390 --> 06:45.240
My mother said

06:47.490 --> 06:50.650
these sects have good relations
with the Xiao family.

06:51.600 --> 06:53.260
After we send off Old Madam Wu,

06:53.560 --> 06:54.820
I'll ask them for help.

06:56.600 --> 06:59.730
Righteousness always comes first
in the martial world.

07:01.270 --> 07:02.040
I believe

07:04.270 --> 07:05.360
they will help us.

07:10.270 --> 07:12.200
Don't be too optimistic, Mr. Xiao.

07:12.600 --> 07:13.800
Throughout history,

07:14.270 --> 07:16.000
people only pursue two things:

07:16.600 --> 07:17.800
power and profit.

07:18.680 --> 07:21.240
Those with aligned interests
become friends.

07:21.240 --> 07:22.700
Currently, the Power Gang

07:22.750 --> 07:24.610
can offer substantial benefits.

07:24.680 --> 07:26.140
So Huanhua Sect's friends

07:26.310 --> 07:28.170
became the Power Gang's friends.

07:31.430 --> 07:33.750
You're saying they'll stand by
and do nothing?

07:33.750 --> 07:36.190
Everyone acts for their own interests.

07:37.159 --> 07:39.220
This martial world gathers for gain.

07:39.750 --> 07:41.210
It's always been this way.

07:47.480 --> 07:48.070
No.

07:51.750 --> 07:53.830
I used to read stories
about the martial world.

07:53.830 --> 07:56.360
They had flashing blades,
revenge and honor.

07:56.680 --> 07:59.750
But stories are just stories.

08:01.510 --> 08:03.600
Now that I'm in this world,

08:04.510 --> 08:06.510
this is exactly where I wanted to be.

08:09.830 --> 08:12.630
There will always be some people
who fear nothing.

08:15.600 --> 08:17.260
They stand up for what's right

08:19.480 --> 08:20.740
and fight for the weak.

08:31.800 --> 08:32.860
But how many people

08:33.549 --> 08:34.350
are like that?

08:47.240 --> 08:48.030
I don't know.

08:51.480 --> 08:52.870
But my father told me

08:53.390 --> 08:55.320
even a tiny spark can start a blaze.

08:55.440 --> 08:57.080
Those with righteous hearts

08:58.270 --> 09:01.080
will always find each other.

09:02.150 --> 09:03.440
So that's why...

09:06.840 --> 09:10.240
Chivalry is the foundation
of the martial world.

09:12.270 --> 09:13.600
Let's make a bet

09:15.240 --> 09:18.600
to see if this martial world
gathers for gain

09:19.150 --> 09:20.270
or chivalry.

09:25.750 --> 09:26.360
Fine.

09:27.960 --> 09:28.960
I'll bet with you.

09:29.550 --> 09:30.810
What are you wagering?

09:31.670 --> 09:32.360
The winner

09:32.720 --> 09:35.030
can take one treasured item
from the loser.

09:35.030 --> 09:36.030
A treasured item?

09:37.670 --> 09:38.730
Just a suggestion.

09:40.790 --> 09:43.120
I'm only trying to
use something intimidating

09:43.120 --> 09:44.120
to wake you up.

09:44.630 --> 09:47.430
If you don't like it,
we can choose something else.

09:48.790 --> 09:49.480
No problem.

09:50.750 --> 09:51.840
I'll take that bet,

09:52.550 --> 09:53.950
but you're going to lose.

09:55.320 --> 09:56.080
I hope so.

09:58.750 --> 09:59.880
Third Young Master!

10:06.120 --> 10:06.720
There's a problem.

10:06.720 --> 10:08.550
Zhang Si just told me the cart broke down.

10:08.550 --> 10:11.080
He can't go out to dump
the night soil tonight.

10:12.240 --> 10:13.970
But we must leave town tonight.

10:16.200 --> 10:17.480
Hongxiu, how about this?

10:17.480 --> 10:20.240
Go find me a black cloak

10:20.600 --> 10:21.660
and get a carriage.

10:21.910 --> 10:23.510
How do you plan to leave town?

10:23.670 --> 10:24.870
Fight fire with fire.

10:25.120 --> 10:27.250
Since the Power Gang is looking for us,

10:27.550 --> 10:30.840
why don't we pretend to be their members?

10:31.550 --> 10:32.030
This...

10:35.360 --> 10:36.120
Don't worry.

10:46.200 --> 10:47.270
What's your plan?

10:51.200 --> 10:54.510
Tang Rou and the others
helped me write about

10:54.720 --> 10:56.630
many famous figures in the martial world.

10:56.630 --> 10:58.360
I've discovered that this Power Gang

10:58.360 --> 10:59.870
not only has many members,

11:00.320 --> 11:02.050
but also has spies everywhere.

11:02.440 --> 11:03.840
They're not even united.

11:04.240 --> 11:04.960
So,

11:05.750 --> 11:07.200
according to my deduction,

11:07.200 --> 11:09.480
very few people know

11:09.750 --> 11:12.320
how Li Chenzhou, Zhao Shirong,
and Liu Suifeng

11:12.320 --> 11:13.450
actually look like.

11:14.870 --> 11:15.390
What?

11:16.270 --> 11:17.730
You want to be Li Chenzhou?

11:18.390 --> 11:19.030
Wrong.

11:19.630 --> 11:21.510
Li Chenzhou is too high and mighty.

11:21.510 --> 11:23.310
How could he possibly come here?

11:23.440 --> 11:25.840
I want to be Liu Suifeng.

11:38.200 --> 11:38.930
Hand it over.

11:50.750 --> 11:52.150
If I remember correctly,

11:52.720 --> 11:55.910
this Liu Suifeng also has a white fan.

12:01.200 --> 12:02.260
Let me borrow this.

12:08.510 --> 12:10.840
But Liu Suifeng's subordinate,
Song Mingzhu,

12:10.840 --> 12:11.900
just arrived here.

12:12.440 --> 12:14.500
Aren't you afraid she'll notice you?

12:15.480 --> 12:17.790
I can tell your observation skills
are poor.

12:17.790 --> 12:19.550
Who was chasing us

12:19.720 --> 12:21.200
all along this journey?

12:21.200 --> 12:22.790
Have you thought carefully about it?

12:22.790 --> 12:24.000
The people hunting us

12:24.320 --> 12:26.720
were wearing different colored clothing.

12:28.960 --> 12:31.090
Then who do you want me to impersonate?

12:32.000 --> 12:32.910
Zhao Shirong.

12:33.270 --> 12:33.840
No way.

12:34.360 --> 12:36.090
You're being difficult again.

12:36.480 --> 12:38.270
Why don't you pretend to be Zhao Shirong

12:38.270 --> 12:40.000
and I pretend to be Liu Suifeng?

12:41.750 --> 12:43.240
What's wrong with your memory?

12:43.240 --> 12:44.960
You have a grudge with the Power Gang.

12:44.960 --> 12:46.440
You shouldn't show your face in public.

12:46.440 --> 12:48.900
Just stay in the carriage
and don't come out.

12:49.120 --> 12:49.850
Don't worry.

12:50.030 --> 12:51.840
I absolutely won't make you
dress as a woman.

12:51.840 --> 12:53.750
I won't make you
wear women's clothes either.

12:53.750 --> 12:55.600
You've been in the martial world
for so many years.

12:55.600 --> 12:57.840
You must know something about them.

12:58.080 --> 13:00.610
Just don't mess things up
when the time comes.

13:03.870 --> 13:04.870
Use the fan well.

13:13.900 --> 13:20.590
[Lingliang Town]

13:20.810 --> 13:22.750
[Annihilation Demon, Xinhu Hill]

13:27.150 --> 13:28.150
Stop right there!

13:28.510 --> 13:29.570
Didn't you hear me?

13:29.630 --> 13:31.750
No one is allowed to leave town.

13:32.660 --> 13:33.940
You bunch of dogs,

13:34.720 --> 13:37.360
how dare you stop this carriage?

13:38.120 --> 13:39.580
Who is speaking so boldly?

14:01.600 --> 14:03.840
A plain fan with a five-petal orchid.

14:07.350 --> 14:09.750
Could it be Deputy Chief Liu?

14:14.440 --> 14:16.700
Is that the Chief's wife in the carriage?

14:21.240 --> 14:22.840
Is that any of your business?

14:23.150 --> 14:24.550
It's not that I don't believe you.

14:24.550 --> 14:26.340
I just have orders
to guard this place.

14:26.340 --> 14:27.600
I cannot be negligent.

14:27.600 --> 14:29.120
Few in our gang have ever seen

14:29.120 --> 14:30.720
the Chief's wife and Deputy Chief Liu.

14:30.720 --> 14:35.480
Could you show me
the Deputy Chief's token?

14:36.390 --> 14:38.070
You must be tired of living.

14:48.030 --> 14:48.790
Years ago,

14:50.160 --> 14:51.880
I once accidentally glimpsed

14:53.370 --> 14:55.560
the back of the Madam in the gang.

15:03.190 --> 15:03.850
How dare you

15:05.360 --> 15:06.480
offend the Madam?

15:06.950 --> 15:08.980
I humbly dare.

15:16.480 --> 15:18.840
That was the Flowing Cloud Sleeve?

15:20.480 --> 15:21.840
It really is the Chief's wife.

15:21.840 --> 15:22.770
Get out of my way.

15:26.320 --> 15:27.250
I deserve to die.

15:28.120 --> 15:29.380
Everyone, step aside!

15:31.200 --> 15:31.960
Bow.

15:43.230 --> 15:43.990
Thank you.

15:45.080 --> 15:47.200
If you meet Miss Hongxiu again,

15:47.750 --> 15:49.680
please return this garment to her.

15:49.720 --> 15:50.270
Alright.

15:50.720 --> 15:52.600
We must first thank you, sir.

15:53.000 --> 15:54.200
Otherwise, who knows

15:54.600 --> 15:55.600
how long we'd be trapped

15:55.600 --> 15:56.860
in Lingliang Town for?

15:57.150 --> 15:59.390
Sir, we'll take our leave now.

15:59.870 --> 16:00.510
Farewell.

16:08.550 --> 16:10.550
Mr. Xiao, let's get going too.

16:13.070 --> 16:14.740
I just saw you seem to have used

16:14.870 --> 16:17.600
Zhao Shirong's
Flowing Cloud Sleeve technique.

16:17.790 --> 16:19.550
You know how to do it too?

16:20.600 --> 16:22.730
It's just some tricks to scare people.

16:22.840 --> 16:24.720
Haven't you always called me Lucky Bag?

16:24.720 --> 16:26.920
I ought to know some rare tricks, right?

16:27.910 --> 16:29.600
It's getting late. Let's go.

16:34.270 --> 16:35.930
Does Feng Lang know this much?

16:37.670 --> 16:38.330
Never mind.

16:39.120 --> 16:41.150
Meeting with Old Madam Wu is more urgent.

16:41.150 --> 16:43.410
I wonder if Yiren has reached Guangling.

16:44.270 --> 16:45.360
Once this matter is settled,

16:45.360 --> 16:47.490
I'll tell Yiren to bring Shinian back.

16:47.870 --> 16:49.530
He can also help Huanhua Sect.

16:52.790 --> 16:53.650
You're so slow.

16:53.870 --> 16:55.470
I thought you'd been caught.

16:55.510 --> 16:57.120
We had to use
quite some tricks to get out.

16:57.120 --> 16:59.180
How did it go? Did you see Old Madam Wu?

16:59.240 --> 17:00.270
I've been watching all day.

17:00.270 --> 17:01.470
People came and went.

17:01.630 --> 17:03.560
I only found Power Gang's minions.

17:03.600 --> 17:05.000
Did you find our contact?

17:05.589 --> 17:06.510
He left a letter

17:06.640 --> 17:07.640
and changed the meeting place.

17:07.640 --> 17:10.170
He told me to bring Old Madam Wu
to the meeting.

17:11.109 --> 17:12.880
Where should we go now?

17:14.920 --> 17:18.069
They must have left markers along the way.

17:18.640 --> 17:19.829
If we find the marker,

17:19.829 --> 17:21.829
we might be able to find Old Madam Wu.

17:24.550 --> 17:25.079
Let's go.

18:03.200 --> 18:04.130
Don't be afraid.

18:05.270 --> 18:07.680
He passed out
because the poison reached his heart.

18:07.680 --> 18:10.410
Fortunately,
he's regained consciousness now.

18:10.590 --> 18:11.920
Thank you for your help.

18:12.880 --> 18:13.810
Don't be afraid.

18:15.310 --> 18:16.910
We're from the Huanhua Sect.

18:17.510 --> 18:20.270
What exactly happened here?

18:20.510 --> 18:23.200
They were making medicinal pills here.

18:23.640 --> 18:25.170
They forced us to test them.

18:25.830 --> 18:27.690
If we refused, they would kill us.

18:27.920 --> 18:29.960
If we obeyed and took their pills,

18:30.400 --> 18:31.310
most of us

18:32.790 --> 18:34.270
went mad

18:35.270 --> 18:36.670
and died from poisoning.

18:39.030 --> 18:40.630
What kind of pills were they?

18:43.160 --> 18:45.750
I only know that after taking their pills,

18:47.160 --> 18:48.920
we felt neither tired nor hungry,

18:48.920 --> 18:50.180
but we became violent.

18:50.790 --> 18:52.520
It's indeed the Marching Pill.

18:53.240 --> 18:55.750
Who were the people
that forced you to make these pills?

18:55.750 --> 18:57.680
Could they be Northern Wastelanders?

18:57.680 --> 18:58.160
No.

18:59.030 --> 19:01.200
They're from the martial world.

19:01.640 --> 19:05.440
I saw their tokens had a cauldron symbol
carved on them.

19:05.680 --> 19:06.740
A cauldron symbol?

19:08.160 --> 19:08.790
Yiren,

19:09.590 --> 19:11.050
could it be the Power Gang?

19:13.400 --> 19:15.070
Are there any other survivors?

19:15.070 --> 19:15.640
Well...

19:17.440 --> 19:18.170
Don't worry.

19:18.510 --> 19:20.070
My sister is a skilled physician.

19:20.070 --> 19:21.790
She can definitely heal you all.

19:21.790 --> 19:24.200
Miss, please save us.

19:25.790 --> 19:26.590
Rest assured.

20:07.160 --> 20:09.000
We should arrive
after walking a bit further.

20:09.000 --> 20:09.530
Let's go.

20:13.730 --> 20:17.630
[Huanhua Sect Guangling Villa]

20:18.570 --> 20:21.020
[Nangong Xiaoyi]

20:20.000 --> 20:22.480
Yiren, Kaiyan, Xueyu!

20:22.510 --> 20:23.310
Xiaoyi?

20:24.790 --> 20:26.450
Xiaoyi, what brings you here?

20:26.840 --> 20:28.240
I knew you all came to Guangling,

20:28.240 --> 20:29.590
so I had to come see you.

20:30.000 --> 20:31.970
It's been over three years
since we last parted.

20:31.970 --> 20:33.680
How are all the elders and siblings

20:33.680 --> 20:35.280
in the Nangong family doing?

20:35.590 --> 20:36.920
They're all doing well.

20:42.000 --> 20:44.480
Yiren, you must be tired
from your journey.

20:46.920 --> 20:49.750
If we can get to the bottom
of this Marching Pill matter,

20:49.750 --> 20:51.610
this little hardship is nothing.

20:52.960 --> 20:55.360
However, this case is indeed quite tricky.

20:56.000 --> 20:57.400
Let's go inside and talk.

21:03.720 --> 21:04.400
Yiren.

21:05.110 --> 21:07.110
I think we should just drop it.

21:08.000 --> 21:09.350
In today's martial world,

21:09.350 --> 21:11.280
who dares to offend the Power Gang?

21:11.720 --> 21:15.180
If we keep pursuing this,
we'll bring trouble upon ourselves.

21:16.230 --> 21:17.290
But Yiren came here

21:17.550 --> 21:20.200
precisely because our family
has a responsibility to uncover the truth.

21:20.200 --> 21:22.000
How can we back down from trouble?

21:22.000 --> 21:22.680
Yes.

21:23.480 --> 21:25.880
But knowing our limits isn't wrong either.

21:28.110 --> 21:31.710
We should certainly view
the martial world's affairs as our own.

21:31.790 --> 21:34.590
But this is the Power Gang
we're talking about.

21:40.350 --> 21:41.000
Yiren,

21:41.680 --> 21:43.340
why don't we ask Father first?

21:46.510 --> 21:48.480
The Marching Pill matter
is of great importance.

21:48.480 --> 21:51.540
Making enemies rashly
will only harm the Huanhua Sect.

21:51.640 --> 21:53.960
Then send a message by carrier pigeon
to Huanhua Sect immediately.

21:53.960 --> 21:56.590
We'll make a decision
after consulting with Father.

21:56.590 --> 21:57.190
All right.

22:09.790 --> 22:10.350
-Third Young Master.
-Third Young Master.

22:10.350 --> 22:11.240
How is everyone doing?

22:11.240 --> 22:12.840
-Big Brother.
-Big Brother.

22:13.020 --> 22:14.220
You're finally here.

22:14.350 --> 22:16.640
We found that Lingliang Town
has been taken over by the Power Gang.

22:16.640 --> 22:18.310
We had to settle in this rundown place.

22:18.310 --> 22:20.160
We were worried you wouldn't find us.

22:20.160 --> 22:20.920
I told you

22:21.110 --> 22:22.880
Qiushui would never overlook my signal.

22:22.880 --> 22:25.680
Why do you do whatever this person says?

22:25.880 --> 22:27.740
You didn't even tell your sister.

22:28.240 --> 22:29.920
Fang, I mean...

22:30.400 --> 22:32.150
I trust your martial arts skills

22:32.150 --> 22:33.880
and Big Brother's strategies.

22:34.000 --> 22:35.310
Didn't everything work out fine?

22:35.310 --> 22:36.370
Enough, all of you.

22:36.790 --> 22:38.450
I got a letter from Tongfu Inn.

22:38.830 --> 22:40.590
I need to see Old Madam Wu immediately.

22:40.590 --> 22:41.400
Let's go now.

22:41.790 --> 22:42.350
Qiushui.

22:45.270 --> 22:47.200
Jiesheng and I just found this place.

22:47.200 --> 22:48.330
Sorry for the delay.

22:48.900 --> 22:49.690
Uncle Kang.

22:56.030 --> 22:59.490
Fortunately, Qiushui brought a message
from Lingliang Town.

22:59.590 --> 23:03.070
Otherwise, we might've missed the news
about this meeting.

23:03.880 --> 23:06.200
How is the Xiao family doing now?

23:07.030 --> 23:09.430
Once General Wu's troops arrive tomorrow,

23:09.590 --> 23:12.160
I'll seek help
from allies in the martial world

23:12.160 --> 23:13.620
to rescue the Xiao family.

23:14.200 --> 23:16.130
Please rest assured, Old Madam Wu.

23:16.790 --> 23:18.320
I'll keep track of the time.

23:19.640 --> 23:20.640
That's good then.

23:22.550 --> 23:23.160
Good.

23:23.700 --> 23:27.500
Everyone who escaped from
the Xiao Residence has finally gathered.

23:29.270 --> 23:30.000
Old Madam Wu.

23:30.480 --> 23:33.110
The letter says the meeting place
is not far from here.

23:33.110 --> 23:34.400
It's already quite late.

23:34.400 --> 23:36.200
Why don't we head there now?

23:36.680 --> 23:39.070
Since it's not far
and everyone is exhausted from traveling,

23:39.070 --> 23:41.000
we'd better rest for a while first.

23:42.270 --> 23:42.960
All right.

23:59.480 --> 24:00.160
Qiushui.

24:00.750 --> 24:02.810
After tomorrow's matter is settled,

24:02.920 --> 24:05.120
I will personally take you to seek help.

24:06.350 --> 24:07.610
Thank you, Uncle Kang.

24:09.440 --> 24:12.270
Mr. Kang, Third Young Master,
the porridge is ready.

24:12.270 --> 24:14.200
Take it to the people inside first.

24:16.480 --> 24:18.140
How's this blade? Take a look.

24:20.400 --> 24:21.880
Old Madam Wu, Mr. Zhang,

24:21.960 --> 24:23.490
please have some porridge.

24:27.110 --> 24:31.720
Mr. Zhang, thank you for escorting me
all the way. You've worked hard.

24:32.640 --> 24:33.970
Thank you, Old Madam Wu.

24:50.480 --> 24:52.680
Something's wrong with this porridge!

25:07.790 --> 25:08.440
Mr. Zhang!

25:08.680 --> 25:09.410
Old Madam Wu.

25:10.030 --> 25:10.590
Are you all right?

25:10.590 --> 25:11.310
I'm fine.

25:26.920 --> 25:29.240
You've all been poisoned
with a muscle relaxant.

25:29.240 --> 25:31.170
Let's see how long you can hold out.

25:32.830 --> 25:34.440
Uncle Kang, you...

25:34.790 --> 25:35.900
This is hardly the time

25:35.900 --> 25:37.360
to still call him "Uncle."

25:41.130 --> 25:42.460
You're quite the actor.

25:43.030 --> 25:44.560
You're from the Power Gang.

25:46.180 --> 25:48.810
[Kang Chuyu]
[The Power Gang's Nameless Demon]

25:49.070 --> 25:52.830
All these years,
to solve problems for the gang,

25:53.920 --> 25:55.830
I had to protect my reputation.

25:56.550 --> 25:58.480
I was treading on thin ice every day.

25:58.480 --> 26:01.810
Otherwise, how could I have
let you take advantage of things

26:02.160 --> 26:05.680
and even nominated you
as the young leader?

26:08.310 --> 26:10.920
Xiao Qiushui, I must kill you today

26:11.350 --> 26:13.550
to vent the hatred I've been harboring.

26:14.110 --> 26:16.170
Do you really think that the two of you

26:16.230 --> 26:17.400
can kill all of us?

26:21.200 --> 26:23.380
Who said there are only two of us?

26:29.000 --> 26:29.600
Watch out!

26:39.110 --> 26:40.920
Take Old Madam Wu away first.
I'll hold them off.

26:40.920 --> 26:41.450
Alright.

27:03.830 --> 27:04.640
What's that?

27:05.040 --> 27:06.580
Who is that demon on horseback?

27:06.580 --> 27:09.110
[Yan Guigui]
[The Power Gang's Iron Cavalry Demon]

27:07.510 --> 27:09.550
That's Yan Guigui, the Iron Cavalry Demon.

27:09.550 --> 27:10.680
He's nothing but a beast.

27:10.680 --> 27:11.880
He shows no humanity.

27:14.160 --> 27:15.620
Protect Old Madam Wu well.

27:39.640 --> 27:40.500
Zuoqiu, Yuhan!

28:55.160 --> 28:55.890
Old Madam Wu.

28:56.640 --> 28:57.420
It's Song Mingzhu.

28:57.420 --> 28:58.810
She stole Old Madam Wu's bundle.

28:58.810 --> 28:59.720
I'll go after her.

28:59.720 --> 29:00.320
Feng Lang!

29:00.750 --> 29:02.350
Young hero, don't chase her!

29:03.060 --> 29:06.390
The Hero Command Token is actually kept in
the Nirvana Case.

29:06.590 --> 29:07.880
She won't be able to open it.

29:07.880 --> 29:08.880
Once opened,

29:08.900 --> 29:11.960
the gold-melting water inside
will dissolve the Hero Command Token.

29:11.960 --> 29:14.960
There has been too much bloodshed
along this journey.

29:15.030 --> 29:16.490
The Hero Command Token...

29:17.270 --> 29:18.220
Let it dissolve.

29:25.270 --> 29:28.230
Old Madam Wu,
your safety is what matters most.

29:29.130 --> 29:30.930
Big Brother, I'll go after them.

29:32.830 --> 29:33.490
Be careful.

29:39.550 --> 29:40.360
Shorty?

29:40.810 --> 29:44.010
There are actually two people
inside Yan Guigui's armor?

29:45.440 --> 29:47.170
I've been the legs for 10 years.

29:47.350 --> 29:49.030
Thank you for killing my brother!

29:49.030 --> 29:50.630
I can finally be the head now!

29:51.600 --> 29:54.030
Brothers, protect Old Madam Wu well.

29:58.360 --> 29:59.890
Are you two going to kill me?

30:00.110 --> 30:01.400
Are you looking down on me?

30:01.400 --> 30:02.000
Yep.

30:02.400 --> 30:04.530
You seem far weaker than your brother.

30:42.310 --> 30:42.840
Let's go.

31:07.610 --> 31:09.740
Old Madam Wu is our priority. Let's go.

31:15.360 --> 31:15.880
Master.

31:27.440 --> 31:29.070
It is indeed the Nirvana Case.

31:29.070 --> 31:29.960
Just as I glimpsed earlier,

31:29.960 --> 31:31.890
this is exactly what it looks like.

31:32.360 --> 31:33.560
Forcing this box open

31:33.590 --> 31:35.110
will destroy the Hero Command Token.

31:35.110 --> 31:36.720
Old Madam Wu is
the mother of a great general.

31:36.720 --> 31:37.780
If we threaten her,

31:37.790 --> 31:40.050
she will never tell us
how to open the box.

31:40.680 --> 31:42.270
So you're planning

31:42.270 --> 31:44.800
to trick Old Madam Wu
into opening it herself?

31:47.790 --> 31:48.480
Master!

31:52.580 --> 31:55.050
I injured myself.
It has nothing to do with you.

31:55.050 --> 31:56.710
No matter what happens later,

31:57.000 --> 31:58.530
you must not show yourself.

32:11.460 --> 32:12.120
Don't move!

32:12.160 --> 32:12.890
Old Madam Wu!

32:13.310 --> 32:13.770
Zuoqiu!

32:19.270 --> 32:20.240
Old Madam Wu,

32:20.830 --> 32:23.070
my son and I
finally managed to lose Zhang Linyi

32:23.070 --> 32:24.030
and came here.

32:24.590 --> 32:27.320
And now you tell me
the Hero Command Token is gone?

32:27.400 --> 32:28.200
Should I...

32:30.200 --> 32:31.680
Kill another person

32:32.510 --> 32:34.510
to help you think carefully?

32:35.200 --> 32:35.720
You!

32:36.000 --> 32:37.160
Kang Chuyu, stop!

32:44.000 --> 32:45.200
-Big Brother!
-Fang!

32:51.270 --> 32:52.000
Kang Chuyu,

32:52.590 --> 32:54.050
you're truly despicable.

32:55.000 --> 32:56.860
My father has known you for years,

32:57.830 --> 32:59.110
yet he misjudged you.

32:59.480 --> 33:00.240
Tell me,

33:00.790 --> 33:03.110
what did the Power Gang offer you?

33:03.480 --> 33:07.790
I was already the Power Gang's demon
long before I became famous.

33:09.200 --> 33:11.310
I've just been hiding my identity.

33:11.480 --> 33:12.790
No one bribed me.

33:13.160 --> 33:14.820
So you're the Nameless Demon!

33:14.880 --> 33:17.720
Nameless yet famous.

33:18.440 --> 33:20.170
Whoever the gang needs me to be,

33:20.440 --> 33:21.640
that's who I am.

33:22.350 --> 33:23.750
Too afraid to have a name,

33:23.830 --> 33:25.830
yet pretending to be a hero for years.

33:25.830 --> 33:26.830
How pathetic.

33:28.240 --> 33:29.480
Say what you want.

33:30.000 --> 33:31.930
I only want the Hero Command Token.

33:35.070 --> 33:36.680
Where is it?

33:37.750 --> 33:38.640
Where is it?

33:39.440 --> 33:40.550
Tell me where it is now!

33:40.550 --> 33:41.410
Stop shouting.

33:41.450 --> 33:43.480
Song Mingzhu took the Hero Command Token.

33:43.480 --> 33:45.590
She abandoned you
to claim the credit herself.

33:45.590 --> 33:47.390
The Nameless Demon, Kang Chuyu,

33:47.750 --> 33:50.210
will be known
throughout Jiangnan by tomorrow.

33:50.210 --> 33:51.340
Not necessarily.

33:52.070 --> 33:54.240
If you all die here today,

33:55.800 --> 33:58.750
I'll remain nameless.

33:59.730 --> 34:00.620
Kang Chuyu,

34:01.350 --> 34:03.280
still defiant in the face of death?

34:04.110 --> 34:08.480
Then I'll kill your friend first.

34:08.480 --> 34:09.110
No!

34:11.070 --> 34:11.670
Wait!

34:14.250 --> 34:17.050
Here's the Hero Command Token.
Don't hurt anyone.

34:21.060 --> 34:21.989
You're wounded?

34:23.239 --> 34:24.040
It's nothing.

34:31.620 --> 34:32.219
Feng Lang!

34:35.360 --> 34:36.159
Catch!

34:50.550 --> 34:51.030
Fang!

34:59.340 --> 35:00.070
Big Brother!

35:21.250 --> 35:21.930
Tang Rou!

35:22.000 --> 35:22.730
Fall in line!

35:23.020 --> 35:24.930
-Old Madam Wu, I’m late.
-Old Madam Wu.

35:24.930 --> 35:25.600
Tang Rou.

35:28.670 --> 35:29.320
Tang Rou!

35:29.400 --> 35:29.930
Tang Rou!

35:32.620 --> 35:33.150
Tang Rou.

35:36.410 --> 35:37.030
Jiesheng!

35:39.880 --> 35:42.110
Don't let these two villains escape!

35:43.000 --> 35:43.760
Fire!

35:53.550 --> 35:54.150
Father,

35:54.590 --> 35:55.320
run!

35:55.840 --> 35:56.710
Run!

35:57.110 --> 35:57.710
Jiesheng!

36:00.920 --> 36:02.320
Go!

36:21.280 --> 36:21.920
Tang Rou.

36:22.800 --> 36:23.440
Tang Rou.

36:24.320 --> 36:24.920
Tang Rou.

36:25.280 --> 36:25.880
Fang.

36:27.510 --> 36:28.320
Big Brother.

36:36.030 --> 36:36.760
Mr. Feng.

36:39.920 --> 36:40.650
Big Brother.

36:40.860 --> 36:41.790
How is Feng Lang?

36:41.880 --> 36:43.410
He must be treated quickly.

36:47.030 --> 36:49.440
Tang Rou, Tang Rou!

36:49.590 --> 36:50.790
-Tang Rou!
-Tang Rou.

36:51.030 --> 36:51.670
Tang Rou.

36:53.800 --> 36:55.840
Old Madam Wu, please save Rou.

37:04.230 --> 37:04.960
Old Madam Wu,

37:05.480 --> 37:08.640
Tang Rou's heart meridian
has been severed by the sword energy.

37:08.640 --> 37:10.000
He's beyond saving now.

37:31.360 --> 37:32.090
Big Brother.

37:35.000 --> 37:35.630
Tang Rou.

37:39.320 --> 37:39.920
Tang Rou.

37:44.680 --> 37:45.280
Fang.

37:48.110 --> 37:48.760
Fang.

37:54.110 --> 37:55.480
Why are you so foolish?

37:56.190 --> 37:57.920
Why did you take that hit for me?

37:59.030 --> 37:59.630
Fang.

38:03.070 --> 38:04.070
I'm happy I could

38:07.230 --> 38:08.160
save my friends.

38:14.390 --> 38:16.720
I'm just sorry for making you angry again.

38:18.920 --> 38:19.400
You...

38:22.700 --> 38:25.100
How am I supposed to
explain this to Father?

38:29.800 --> 38:32.130
In the Tang Sect, only the strong survive.

38:34.480 --> 38:35.410
In recent years,

38:37.510 --> 38:39.780
our branch of the family
has lost influence.

38:39.780 --> 38:42.110
I was hoping to
build a reputation as a hero

38:45.550 --> 38:46.750
and make more friends

38:47.660 --> 38:49.230
to share Father's burden.

38:54.400 --> 38:55.530
But unfortunately,

38:56.670 --> 38:57.870
this is where it ends.

39:05.710 --> 39:06.190
Fang.

39:09.440 --> 39:10.000
Fang.

39:12.670 --> 39:13.330
From now on,

39:15.480 --> 39:17.080
I entrust everything to you.

39:29.340 --> 39:31.650
♪ Huanhua flower withers ♪

39:31.670 --> 39:36.380
♪ What's the meaning of my life? ♪

39:32.510 --> 39:33.070
Fang,

39:34.230 --> 39:35.230
I have some things

39:36.440 --> 39:37.470
to tell Big Brother.

39:36.640 --> 39:38.990
♪ The wind blows ♪

39:39.020 --> 39:43.460
♪ Like a farewell song ♪

39:40.840 --> 39:42.920
What can't you say in front of me?

39:44.060 --> 39:46.510
♪ Who accompanies when the qin breaks? ♪

39:44.130 --> 39:44.900
Fang.

39:46.530 --> 39:49.000
♪ How much sadness is there? ♪

39:49.020 --> 39:52.130
♪ Gazing at the moon
at the end of the world ♪

39:52.820 --> 40:00.100
♪ Tears fall unrestrained;
the leaves are unswayed ♪

40:00.480 --> 40:01.010
Tang Rou.

40:03.920 --> 40:04.960
What are you talking about?

40:04.130 --> 40:07.230
♪ Unspoken regret, shattered in the sand ♪

40:07.000 --> 40:08.070
You'll definitely be fine.

40:07.360 --> 40:10.580
♪ Yesterday was a dream
difficult to find ♪

40:09.630 --> 40:11.160
You'll definitely be fine.

40:11.530 --> 40:14.810
♪ So far away in the blink of an eye ♪

40:14.880 --> 40:17.870
♪ With weeds overgrown, where is home? ♪

40:19.040 --> 40:22.240
♪ Owing love and hate;
favors and feuds rain down ♪

40:21.440 --> 40:22.260
I still remember

40:22.260 --> 40:26.000
♪ Too many apologies to be said ♪

40:23.590 --> 40:25.280
when we first met,

40:26.440 --> 40:29.330
♪ Missed in the intersection of time ♪

40:26.710 --> 40:28.310
I asked you why you helped me.

40:29.400 --> 40:32.030
You said the martial world is like water

40:30.150 --> 40:32.390
♪ The inevitable destiny ♪

40:32.900 --> 40:34.890
♪ The moon is reflected in the water ♪

40:33.030 --> 40:34.560
with unfathomable depths.

40:34.910 --> 40:38.970
♪ Not even a ripple is left behind ♪

40:35.630 --> 40:37.290
Only with one's sword as an oar

40:38.280 --> 40:39.810
and righteousness as a boat

40:40.510 --> 40:41.440
can one advance.

40:40.630 --> 40:43.300
♪ The broken sword can't be pulled out ♪

40:43.320 --> 40:46.780
♪ It's a heart-breaking punishment ♪

40:47.380 --> 40:49.940
♪ Huanhua flower withers ♪

40:49.110 --> 40:50.320
I'm grateful I could understand

40:49.960 --> 40:54.210
♪ What's the meaning of my life? ♪

40:52.550 --> 40:53.610
these principles.

40:54.680 --> 40:57.130
♪ The wind blows ♪

40:55.230 --> 40:55.880
Tang Rou.

40:57.150 --> 41:02.070
♪ Like a farewell song ♪

41:02.190 --> 41:04.420
♪ Who accompanies when the qin breaks? ♪

41:04.600 --> 41:07.220
♪ How much sadness is there? ♪

41:05.000 --> 41:05.800
I'm sorry.

41:07.240 --> 41:10.460
♪ Gazing at the moon
at the end of the world ♪

41:07.480 --> 41:09.150
I couldn't protect you.

41:10.230 --> 41:11.590
I'm sorry, Tang Rou.

41:11.000 --> 41:17.340
♪ Tears fall unrestrained;
the leaves are unswayed ♪

41:12.590 --> 41:13.320
Big Brother,

41:14.440 --> 41:15.570
what are you saying?

41:18.440 --> 41:19.700
What you've protected

41:20.190 --> 41:22.110
is the world in our hearts.

41:23.620 --> 41:24.500
After I'm gone,

41:27.000 --> 41:29.360
there's one thing I want to ask of you.

41:32.190 --> 41:32.790
What is it?

41:34.400 --> 41:35.670
No matter what it is,

41:37.000 --> 41:38.400
I'll do it for you.

41:42.510 --> 41:43.240
My sister...

41:46.440 --> 41:49.360
My sister just has a sharp tongue.

41:47.250 --> 41:49.230
♪ The moon is reflected in the water ♪

41:49.250 --> 41:53.530
♪ Not even a ripple is left behind ♪

41:50.150 --> 41:52.630
Please be patient with her

41:54.110 --> 41:55.230
and take care of her for me.

41:55.020 --> 41:57.810
♪ The broken sword can't be pulled out ♪

41:56.360 --> 41:58.000
Why are you saying all this?

41:57.840 --> 42:01.790
♪ It's a heart-breaking punishment ♪

41:58.000 --> 41:59.550
I can take care of myself.

42:00.640 --> 42:01.120
Okay.

42:01.970 --> 42:04.360
♪ Huanhua flower withers ♪

42:04.000 --> 42:04.590
Okay.

42:04.380 --> 42:08.880
♪ What's the meaning of my life? ♪

42:09.240 --> 42:11.440
♪ The wind blows ♪

42:11.530 --> 42:16.660
♪ Like a farewell song ♪

42:15.360 --> 42:16.680
The Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood

42:16.680 --> 42:18.680
♪ Who accompanies when the qin breaks? ♪

42:18.110 --> 42:18.880
is great.

42:19.060 --> 42:21.630
♪ How much sadness is there? ♪

42:21.650 --> 42:25.190
♪ Gazing at the moon
at the end of the world ♪

42:24.730 --> 42:25.520
Twenty years later

42:25.210 --> 42:32.920
♪ Tears fall unrestrained;
the leaves are unswayed ♪

42:27.360 --> 42:28.690
when I'm reincarnated,

42:29.450 --> 42:30.340
Shenzhou

42:33.290 --> 42:35.150
should be full of righteousness.

42:35.460 --> 42:37.560
♪ Who accompanies when the qin breaks? ♪

42:36.670 --> 42:38.800
Tang Rou, from now on,

42:37.580 --> 42:39.800
♪ How much sadness is there? ♪

42:40.150 --> 42:42.000
every title we earn in the martial world

42:40.210 --> 42:42.960
♪ Gazing at the moon
at the end of the world ♪

42:43.230 --> 42:44.550
will be earned together with you.

42:43.740 --> 42:49.760
♪ Tears fall unrestrained;
the leaves are unswayed ♪

42:46.030 --> 42:47.960
As long as the Brotherhood exists,

42:48.070 --> 42:49.440
we will always be together.
